      "delta": "\n{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/elements/methodology\",\"value\":{\"type\":\"TextBlock\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"This analysis covers twelve months of subscription activity across three pricing plans. New MRR reflects revenue from first-time subscribers, expansion MRR from"
